description:
Locally I made a helper to capture the calling function name and pass it to `start_local_active_span()`. perhaps it may make sense to have a default `name` argument set to the calling function name similar to the below?

```r
arc_span <- function(
  caller = rlang::call_name(rlang::caller_call())
) {
  if (otel::is_tracing_enabled()) {
    otel::start_local_active_span(
      caller,
      attributes = otel::as_attributes(options)
    )
  }
}
```
